@startuml SD_UC_E1_Create_Order_Course_Firing
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Nhân viên Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "OrderController" as Controller
participant "OrderService" as Service
participant "OrderRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB

== Kịch bản 1: Tạo Order & Khởi chạy Course đầu tiên ==

Waitstaff -> UI: Chọn bàn, thêm món & Lưu
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/orders
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CreateOrderWithCourses(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: InsertOrder(dto)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: INSERT Orders, OrderItems, Courses
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK (OrderId)
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: Saved(OrderId)
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("Kitchen_NewCourse")

Service --> Controller: Result(dto)
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Course 1 đang chế biến
deactivate UI

== Kịch bản 2: Kích hoạt lượt món tiếp theo (Fire Course) ==

Waitstaff -> UI: Bấm Fire Course
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/orders/{id}/fire-course
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: FireNextCourse(id, courseNo)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: UpdateCourseStatus(id, "Cooking")
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: UPDATE Courses
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("Kitchen_FireCourse")

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Cập nhật Course tiếp theo
deactivate UI

== Kịch bản 3: Khách gọi thêm món ==

Waitstaff -> UI: Chọn thêm món & Cập nhật
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/orders/{id}/items
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: AddOrderItems(id, itemsDto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: InsertAdditionalItems(id, itemsDto)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: INSERT OrderItems
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("Kitchen_AdditionalItems")

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Cập nhật đơn hàng thành công
deactivate UI

@enduml